sase-ac.6.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-ac.6","agent_clan_generation":"20260728091555","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-ac.6.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-ac.6[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Finish canonical xprompt project identity and land sase-ac[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Every consumer of a project xprompt namespace uses the canonical [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]user-facing project name, no surface advertises or resolves the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]ProjectSpec directory-key spelling, and epic sase-ac is closed with[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]its plan file marked done.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]xprompt_identity_landing.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Repair project-local definition paths and browser namespaces[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]browser_identity[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]browser_identity: fix the `project_local_config:` definition-path [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]regression and stop `get_all_project_local_prompts()` from emitting [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]directory-key namespaces into the ACE xprompt browser and doctor.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Canonicalize the prompt-bar VCS-tag workspace lookup[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]prompt_bar_identity[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]prompt_bar_identity: normalize the project the prompt-bar xprompt [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]selector derives from the VCS tag before looking up its workspace, so [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]project-local `sase.yml` xprompts stop being silently dropped.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Canonicalize and register-back project workflow loading[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]workflow_identity[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]workflow_identity: give `get_all_workflows()` the same [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]canonical-identity and registry-backed resolution `get_all_xprompts()` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]received, so a project's `.yml` workflow xprompts resolve by canonical [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]name and outside the checkout.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Invalidate the xprompt identity cache on project mutations[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]identity_cache[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]identity_cache: wire `project_identity`'s process-lifetime caches into [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the existing project mutation invalidation paths so a long-running `sase[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ace` does not keep resolving stale project identities.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Land epic sase-ac[/bold #D7AFFF]                                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]land[dim] · [dim][/dim]after browser_identity, prompt_bar_identity, workflow_identity, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]identity_cache[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]land: close bead sase-ac, run symvision and clear anything the expired [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]epic whitelist reports, and mark both plan files done.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-ac.6","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","phase_bead_id":"sase-ac.6.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-cb4cb876664d12b399e9aa2b6eeb6484","started_at":"2026-07-28